timeline
    title Databricks Product Evolution
    section 2013-2019 Founding and open source
        2013 : Databricks founded
        2018 : MLflow open-sourced
        2019 : Delta Lake open-sourced
    section 2020-2021 Lakehouse era
        2020 : Acquired Redash (BI / dashboards)
             : Delta Engine preview (precursor to Photon)
             : SQL Analytics launched
        2021 : Photon GA
             : Delta Live Tables (DLT) launched
             : Workflows launched (orchestration)
             : Unity Catalog announced
             : Delta Sharing announced
             : Acquired 8080 Labs (bamboolib)
    section 2022 Governance and SQL
        2022 : Unity Catalog GA
             : Delta Sharing GA
             : SQL Endpoints renamed SQL Warehouses
             : Serverless SQL GA
             : Marketplace launched
             : Acquired Cortex Labs (model serving)
    section 2023 AI inflection
        2023 : Acquired Okera (governance to UC ABAC)
             : Acquired MosaicML for 1.3B (Mosaic AI brand)
             : Acquired Arcion (CDC to Lakeflow Connect)
             : Vector Search announced
             : Foundation Model APIs launched
             : Lakehouse IQ announced
             : Lakeview Dashboards launched
             : Databricks Connect v2 (Spark Connect)
    section 2024 Lakeflow AI/BI Iceberg
        2024 : Acquired Einblick (AI-native UIs)
             : Acquired Lilac (data curation)
             : Acquired Tabular for 1B+ (Iceberg founders to UniForm)
             : DBRX open-sourced
             : AI/BI announced (Genie plus Dashboards)
             : Lakeview renamed AI/BI Dashboards
             : Lakehouse IQ renamed AI/BI Genie
             : Repos renamed Git folders
             : Single user renamed Dedicated access mode
             : UniForm GA
             : Predictive Optimization GA
             : Lakebase announced (managed Postgres)
             : Mosaic AI Agent Framework
    section 2025 Lakeflow consolidation
        2025 : DLT renamed Lakeflow Spark Declarative Pipelines
             : Workflows renamed Lakeflow Jobs
             : Arcion ingestion renamed Lakeflow Connect
             : Lakebase GA (autoscale plus branching)
             : Databricks Apps GA
             : Zerobus Ingest
             : Agent Bricks (Knowledge Assistants, MAS)
             : Clean Rooms GA
    section 2026 Lakebase wave, AI Search, governance GA
        2026 : Serverless workspaces GA
             : ABAC GA
             : Governed Tags GA
             : Databricks Data Classification GA
             : Catalog commits GA
             : Lakeflow Pipelines Editor GA
             : Vector Search renamed AI Search
             : Simba Spark ODBC renamed Databricks ODBC
             : Power BI compatibility mode removed
             : Legacy Assistant slash commands removed
